<code>assert CollectionUtils.isEqualCollection(this, coll);</code>

However, since the `CollectionUtils.isEqualCollection` method is not a publicly accessible observer method provided in the test function and we need to use only publicly accessible observer methods, we should use the `containsAll` method and compare sizes. Here is the corrected assert statement:

<code>assert coll.size() == this.size() && this.containsAll(coll);</code>
